WEBVTT

00:04:29.704 --> 00:04:30.954
I'm overlooked.

00:04:34.288 --> 00:04:38.996
"You need to work on being
more of a team player," they say.

00:04:40.788 --> 00:04:46.454
"Your approach makes it
difficult to work with you," they say.

00:04:48.079 --> 00:04:53.079
"Try to help others feel
more comfortable around you," they say.

00:04:54.454 --> 00:04:57.204
"You are hurting
your relationships at work

00:04:57.246 --> 00:04:59.204
when you talk about racism,"

00:04:59.954 --> 00:05:01.246
they say.